		(property "Note" "vertical magjack, common centre tap (P5/P6) on all pairs: TX and RX CTs joined (RX is AC-coupled through ref C9/C10, so the RX CT bias is free); 10/100 uses pairs 1-2 only. LEDs (HanRun rev 00 p.1): orange 12 anode -> 11 cathode, green 14 anode -> 13 cathode; anodes on 3V3, cathodes to the W5500 sinks"
